            "question": "What exercises can I do with 50 lb dumbbells?",
            "answer": "The Martian's 10 weight levels (5-50 lbs) support complete full-body training at home.\nYou can perform all major exercises: chest press, shoulder press, rows, squats, deadlifts, lunges, curls, and core movements. The Quick DialTech system lets you easily switch between light weights for isolation exercises (lateral raises at 10 lbs) and heavy weights for compound movements (squats at 50 lbs) in the same workout.\nOne pair replaces 10 traditional dumbbell pairs, giving you gym-level versatility in your home."
          }
        },
