          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can beginners use 50 lb adjustable dumbbells?",
            "answer": "Absolutely! The Martian is perfect for beginners starting their fitness journey.\n\nWhy it works for beginners:\n          Starts at just 5 lbs for learning proper form safely \n          10 gradual weight levels (5 lb increments) let you progress without rushing\n          Simple dial adjustment no confusing pins or clips\n          Safety lock prevents accidental weight changes\n\nProgressive path: Begin with 5-15 lbs, focusing on technique, then gradually increase to 20-30 lbs as you build strength. Within months, you'll progress to 40-50 lbs for compound exercises.\n\nThe Martian grows with you from beginner to intermediate, making it a smart long-term investment versus buying multiple dumbbell sets."
          }
        },
