          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How do Ativafit adjustable dumbbells work?",
            "answer": "Ativafit adjustable dumbbells use a precision DialTech system to change resistance instantly. When the dumbbell is docked in its base, simply hold the safety button and rotate the dial to your desired weight. This engages a specialized 10-point internal locking mechanism that secures the chosen steel plates. Once you lift the handle, the unselected plates remain safely in the tray. It’s a seamless way to access 10 different weight levels—from 5 to 50 lbs—using just one pair of handles."
          }
        },
