          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How much space do 50 lb adjustable dumbbells need?",
            "answer": "Minimal space required: Each Martian dumbbell with its tray measures 16.7\"L × 8.2\"W × 7.7\"H. A complete pair needs just 3 feet of floor space.\nCompare that to traditional dumbbells: Covering the same 5-50 lb range with fixed dumbbells would require 10 pairs and a 6-8 foot rack.\nStorage flexibility: The included trays serve as the base—no rack needed. Fits perfectly in apartments, spare bedrooms, closets, or garage gyms. You can also add our Atlas Stand for elevated, organized storage."
          }
        },
