          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How does the 10-level adjustment on the Martian benefit my workout?",
            "answer": "Unlike many adjustable dumbbells 50 lbs options that have large weight jumps, Martian features 10 precision levels. This allows you to fine-tune your resistance for focused sculpting and technique work. With our Quick DialTech system, you can switch between these levels in seconds, keeping your heart rate up and your workout uninterrupted."
